SUMMARY:5TH ANNUAL NC VETERAN ART SHOW
DESCRIPTION:Please join us for the 5th Annual North Carolina Veteran Art Show from Friday\, October 2nd\, to Friday\, October 16th\, at the Durham Art Guild Golden Belt Gallery.  The Joel Fund and Heart2Hand Veteran artist Lt. Colonel (retired)\, Bernardine Donato\, are excited to host the two-week art exhibit in partnership with Durham Art Guild. This family-friendly art show will contain original pieces created by North Carolina Veterans of all backgrounds\, art levels\, and branches of service. \nTo learn more and submit artwork until September 14th\, please visit: thejoelfund.org/nc-veteran-art-show/ \nGallery Hours:\nMonday – Saturday\, 10 am – 7 pm\nSunday\, 12 pm – 4 pm\nThere is free\, paved parking on site with an accessible entrance. \nDuring the Third Friday Durham Art Walk\, an Artist Talk and Closing Reception is planned for October 16th\, from 6:00-7:15 pm\, with light refreshments until 8:00 pm. This event is designed to foster community engagement and honor the service and artistic talent of North Carolina veterans. The structured program\, from 6:00 PM to 7:15 PM\, will feature a moderated Artist Talk panel\, audience Q&A\, an art tour\, and a meet and greet with veteran artists. Please visit this website to see the other events and galleries that are open for the evening! https://downtowndurham.com/thirdfriday-2/ \nCan’t make it in person? The featured artwork will be on The Joel Fund’s Operation ART Online Gallery\, as well as an online gallery on the DAG website. Click here to see DAG Gallery at Golden Belt. \nIf you have any questions\, please contact Isabella Brezenski\nat 919-200-0886 or via email at isabella@thejoelfund.org.
URL:https://unitedarts.org/calendar/5th-annual-nc-veteran-art-show/
LOCATION:Durham Art Guild\, DAG Golden Belt Gallery\, Mill No. 1 at Golden Belt Campus\, 800 Taylor St.\, Durham\, 27701
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://unitedarts.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/NCVAS-2026-1.png
ORGANIZER;CN="The Joel Fund":MAILTO:isabella@thejoelfund.org
END:VEVENT
