SUMMARY:Profesional Development Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Practical Strategies for supporting students with ADHD\, dyslexia\, autism and\nother learning differences in music classrooms\, ensembles and private lessons. Led by Rhoda Bernard\, Managing Director at the Berklee Institute for Accessible Arts Education.\nOctober 3\, 2026\n10-11:30 am\nZoom\nPresented by the North Carolina Chamber Music Institute. Contact nccmi.office@gmail.com for more info.
URL:https://unitedarts.org/calendar/profesional-development-workshop/
END:VEVENT
