SUMMARY:2026 Costume Sale
DESCRIPTION:Take advantage of great prices on vintage hats\, fun costumes\, and other assorted pieces and accessories from Raleigh Little Theatre’s costumes over the years! Our costume sale is a great resource for school theatre departments\, flea market shoppers\, Halloween costume shoppers\, and anyone looking for something unique. \nThere will be a wide range of prices – some individual items under $5 but full costumes and more ornate items are more expensive. We will accept card and cash. You can find something for any budget and for any occasion! \nRain date: Saturday\, October 17
URL:https://unitedarts.org/calendar/2026-costume-sale/
LOCATION:Raleigh Little Theatre\, 301 Pogue St\, Raleigh\, 27607
ORGANIZER;CN="Raleigh Little Theatre":MAILTO:boxoffice@raleighlittletheatre.org
END:VEVENT
